            "review_title": "Review at Mikado Sushi",
            "review_text": "Илья А\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nI do not recommend\nAug 2026 • Family\n08/22/2026 only from this establishment, didn't like any dish. Everything is tasteless, bland, just rice, undercooked. They were also in line. Wasted my precious time.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 22, 2026\nHiếu\nThank you for sharing your feedback with us. We are truly sorry to hear that your experience on August 22nd did not meet your expectations.\n\nOur restaurant concept focuses on providing a fast-paced, accessible, and casual dining experience for busy crowds. However, undercooked rice and bland food are never acceptable standards for us, even during our busiest peak hours. We take your comments seriously and are addressing this directly with our kitchen team to ensure better consistency.\n\nWe appreciate your honesty as it helps us improve, and we hope you might give us another opportunity in the future to show you a much better experience.\n\nBest regards,\nMikado Sushi Nha Trang\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
